   - The total number of valid teams is the sum of the teams from both cases:
   \[
   \text{Total Teams} = \text{Teams}_{\text{either as spiker}} + \text{Teams}_{\text{either as setter}} = 20 + 20 = 40
   \]

### Final Answer
Thus, the total number of ways to assemble a two-person team such that no player feels out of position is:
\[
\boxed{40}
\]

