     \]
   - The area of one triangle is:
     \[
     \text{Area}_{\text{triangle}} = \frac{1}{2} \times \text{base} \times \text{height} = \frac{1}{2} \times 2 \times \sqrt{3} = \sqrt{3} \text{ square meters}
     \]
