     \]
   - The radius at the top of her head is:
     \[
     r_{\text{head}} = r_{\text{earth}} + \text{height of girl} = 20,908,800 \text{ feet} + 5 \text{ feet} = 20,908,805 \text{ feet}
     \]

4. **Circumference Calculations**:
   - The circumference at her feet:
     \[
     C_{\text{feet}} = 2\pi r_{\text{earth}} = 2\pi (20,908,800) = 41,817,600\pi \text{ feet}
     \]
   - The circumference at the top of her head:
     \[
     C_{\text{head}} = 2\pi r_{\text{head}} = 2\pi (20,908,805) = 41,817,610\pi \text{ feet}
     \]

5. **Finding the Difference**:
   - The difference in distance traveled:
     \[
     \text{Difference} = C_{\text{head}} - C_{\text{feet}} = (41,817,610\pi - 41,817,600\pi) = 10\pi \text{ feet}
     \]

6. **Final Answer**:
