   The number \( 531340_6 \) can be converted to base 10 using the formula:
   \[
   N = d_k \cdot b^k + d_{k-1} \cdot b^{k-1} + \ldots + d_1 \cdot b^1 + d_0 \cdot b^0
   \]
   where \( d_i \) are the digits and \( b \) is the base. For \( 531340_6 \):
   \[
   N = 5 \cdot 6^5 + 3 \cdot 6^4 + 1 \cdot 6^3 + 3 \cdot 6^2 + 4 \cdot 6^1 + 0 \cdot 6^0
   \]
