To solve the problem, we need to determine the number of disjoint open intervals in the domain of the function 

\[
f(x) = \log_{10} \left(\sin(\pi x) \cdot \sin(2 \pi x) \cdots \sin(8 \pi x)\right)
\]

over the interval \([0, 1]\). The function \(f(x)\) is undefined wherever any of the sine terms is zero.

### Step 1: Identifying Zeros
The sine function \(\sin(k \pi x)\) is zero at the points 

\[
