     \[
     \mathbf{P} = \frac{\mathbf{v} \mathbf{v}^T}{\|\mathbf{v}\|^2}
     \]
   - The reflection matrix \(\mathbf{R}\) over the vector \(\mathbf{v}\) can be derived from the projection matrix:
     \[
