   \[
   \det(\mathbf{A} - \lambda \mathbf{I}) = 0
   \]
   where \(\mathbf{I}\) is the identity matrix. This leads to:
   \[
   \det\begin{pmatrix} 19 - \lambda & 30 \\ -45 & -71 - \lambda \end{pmatrix} = (19 - \lambda)(-71 - \lambda) + 1350 = 0
   \]
   Expanding this gives:
   \[
