\]

### Step 5: Product of all possible values of \( z_1 \)

The product of all possible values of \( z_1 \) is:
\[
\text{Product} = 16^n \cdot \text{(product of all } e^{i\theta} \text{ terms)}
\]
Since \( e^{i\theta} \) terms are uniformly distributed around the unit circle, their product is 1.

Thus, the product of all possible values of \( z_1 \) is:
\[
\boxed{16}
\]

