\]

### Final Result

Thus, the ordered triple \( (x, y, z) \) is:

\[
\boxed{(0.4638, 0.3551, 0.1810)}
\]

This result indicates the relative contributions of the vertices \( A, B, \) and \( C \) to the position of the orthocenter \( H \) in triangle \( ABC \).
