\]

### Step 3: Form the Matrix
We can express these vectors in terms of their coefficients:
\[
\begin{bmatrix}
1 & -2 & 3 \\
2 & 3 & -4 \\
0 & p & q
\end{bmatrix}
\]

### Step 4: Calculate the Determinant
The determinant of this matrix must equal zero:
\[
\text{det} = \begin{vmatrix}
1 & -2 & 3 \\
2 & 3 & -4 \\
0 & p & q
\end{vmatrix}
\]

Calculating the determinant using cofactor expansion along the first row:
\[
