    # For each of the remaining candidates, they can either be included in the committee or not
    # This gives us 2 choices (include or exclude) for each of the remaining n-1 candidates
    # Therefore, the total number of ways to choose members-at-large is 2^(n-1)
    members_choices = 2 ** (n - 1)
    
    # Total ways to form the committee is the product of the choices for chairman and members
